                    {
                        "sense_id": "859a2205-69c0-308b-b322-56065fa57e21",
                        "entry_id": "55fc90ba-debd-3190-9ec6-bc265ef4df90",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Characteristic of a traitor; disloyal."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "61f2603b-eae3-4f66-ab70-6e6a0d1321c7",
                                "sense_id": "859a2205-69c0-308b-b322-56065fa57e21",
                                "text": "I tel you true my hart is ſwolne with wrath,\nOn this ſame theeuish villain Tamburlain.\nAnd of that false Coſroe, my traiterous brother,\nWould it not grieue a King to be so abuſ’d?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "de72c063-71f5-4a8e-8fcd-dcb4b3017c73",
                                "sense_id": "859a2205-69c0-308b-b322-56065fa57e21",
                                "text": "I that inceſtuous, that adulterate beaſt, / With witchcraft of his wits, with trayterous gifts, / O wicked wit, and giftes that haue the power / So to ſeduce; wonne to his ſhamefull luſt / The will of my moſt ſeeming vertuous Queene; [...]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f6af22cb-5dd5-30db-b92d-de85a6d7bf19",
                        "entry_id": "55fc90ba-debd-3190-9ec6-bc265ef4df90",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Constituting treason; treasonable or seditious."
